WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.720
Hi, my name is Leland Wang, a rising sophomore
at Morehouse College studying applied physics

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:15.160
and mechanical engineering. I was given the
opportunity to work with Atlanta AI and Robotics

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:21.140
Initiative where I gained a lot of hands-on
experience dealing with Edge AI, AWS, along

00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:26.680
with deploying models on the NVIDIA Jetson Nano
as well. And during my time working there,

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:33.000
I was really surprised by how much integration
goes between hardware, software, and AI. That

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.640
integration is then used to solve a lot of real-
life problems. I was also surprised by

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.760
how much mentorship and guidance came from AARI
where I was able to learn a whole lot

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:54.600
more and do a whole lot of hands-on projects to
then complement my skills. I would definitely

00:00:54.600 --> 00:01:00.380
recommend AARI to any student who's looking to
not just participate in something but really

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:09.960
learn and grow from something as well. Yes, AARI
has permission. Use my quote, name, image,

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.120
video for social media and program promotion.
